# Casino Syndicate

Hardhat in `blockchain` (`contracts`, `scripts`, `test`). Env files stay at the repo root. Two Vite/React/Redux UIs: `client-app` (player table by URL, session deposits) and `admin-app` (factory + table admin, no deposits). Source lives in `src/`. `GameFactory` creates games by `GameType`; roulette is the type. Redux via each app's `app/core/store`.

## Style

- No semicolons, no trailing commas, double quotes, 2-space indent, max 160 cols
- Prefer lodash (`import _ from "lodash"`) at call site over one-off helpers or native equivalents
- No one-off named helpers/wrappers — extract only when reused 2+ times
- Destructure with `|| {}` / `|| []`; avoid `?.` for field reads (optional calls OK)
- No nested ternaries; name booleans. JSX: `&&` not ternary. Imperative: `if`, not `&&`
- No defensive code: no try/catch unless recovering; no fallbacks for required data/env
- Rem for custom sizes (often `0.75rem`). Minimal diffs
- Store collections: `{ [id]: { id, ... } }`. Constants stay arrays. Iterate with `Object.values` / `Object.keys` / lodash
- React UI state via `actions` so handlers live in `actions.js`
- Scope store paths with `actions.create(path | () => path)`

## UI (`client-app`, `admin-app`)

- Imports from `app/` (alias of `src/`): `core/`, `screens/`, `components/`, `games/`
- `actions`/`store` from `app/core/store`
- `React.useState` etc. — never destructure built-ins from `"react"` (third-party hooks unprefixed)
- Redux only: `actions.get/set/update/unset`; `useSelector(() => selectX())`; fetch then select
- Domain modules: selectors → fetchers → mutators → mappers. Fetchers write store only (no side effects)
- Loaders: `setLoader`/`clearLoader`. No nested components, no single-use hooks/JSX vars — Redux + core/games instead
- Mantine + Tailwind + `cn()` from `app/core` (not SCSS). Persist via `PERSISTENT_PATHS` — never localforage from domain modules
- Every UI element has a stable kebab-case class as the first `cn()` argument so the UI can be customized by selector
- Dark editorial chrome (mihaibabet.ro): `#0a0e14`, Syne display, JetBrains Mono UI, teal `#2dd4bf`
- Numbered section labels, bordered surface cards, in-page / header actions — not FABs
- Mantine components over custom chrome; no extra frames, docks, or ornamental UI
- Mantine `NumberInput` for numeric values (amounts, min, max) — not `TextInput`. Keep stepper controls; do not `hideControls`. Clamp on submit, not on each keystroke
- Player app (`client-app`): table by URL only, session deposits, no factory lists
- Admin app (`admin-app`): factory create/list and table admin, no session deposits

## Contracts

- Game logic lives on the game contract (`Roulette.sol`). Factory only creates, indexes, and stores `GameType`
- Solidity keeps required semicolons; do not apply the JS style rules to `.sol`
